To Create file
--------------
vim devops.txt
i -> insert
Ese -> escape mode or cmd
:noh -> No highlight
:set nu -> set numbers
:set nonu -> No numbers
:27d -> To delete 27 line
:%d -> To delete all
:4s/sbin/SBIN (To change name)
:8s/sbin/SBIN/g -> To change total line 
:%s/sbin/SBIN/g -> To replace all in file

ESC Mode
--------
u -> undo
:wq! -> force write and quit
:q -> quit
:wq -> save & exit
:q! -> exit without saving
:/ec2-user -> To search a word in forward
n -> To move
:?sbin -> To search a word in reverse

yy->To copy
p-> paste
U->undo
dd-> cut line
gg->To go top
shift+g->To go bottom
